---
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import RelatedLinks from '../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Brian Merritt | MERRITT.NYC"
  description="About Brian Merritt: Boston roots, life in New York, technology, fatherhood, and an enduring curiosity about how things work."
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="About"
      title="A little more about me."
      subtitle="Originally from Boston, now firmly planted in New York City."
    />

    <div class="prose-stack">
      <section class="prose-section" aria-labelledby="about-intro">
        <h2 id="about-intro">The longer version</h2>
        <p>
          I'm Brian. Originally from Boston, now firmly planted in <a class="quiet-link" href="/new-york/">New York City</a>. I've spent most
          of my career building and scaling technology companies, but there's quite a bit more to
          life than work.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-section" aria-labelledby="family-heading">
        <h2 id="family-heading">Being Dad</h2>
        <p>
          I'm the father of two teenage daughters. They're smart, funny, opinionated, and completely
          different from each other.
        </p>
        <p>
          One has a creative streak and a love of the arts and sciences. The other has an
          imagination that runs circles around mine, with interests ranging from animation to
          mythology.
        </p>
        <p>
          Being their dad is easily the most important part of my life. We also started
          <a class="quiet-link" href="/collection/">the LEGO collection</a> together with the World Map.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
        <h2 id="work-heading">Work</h2>
        <p>
          I've spent my career helping software and technology companies grow. Today, I work in AI
          and software, which means I get to spend a lot of time around technology that's changing
          faster than most of us can keep up with.
        </p>
        <p>Some of what I'm building and testing lives in <a class="quiet-link" href="/projects/">Projects & experiments</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-section" aria-labelledby="curiosity-heading">
        <h2 id="curiosity-heading">Curiosity</h2>
        <p>
          I've always liked figuring out how things work, especially when they probably don't need
          fixing. That curiosity has led to <a class="quiet-link" href="/lab/">a collection of Macs, home servers, and AI experiments</a>,
          <a class="quiet-link" href="/collection/">LEGO models</a>, and a few projects that have taken considerably longer than expected.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <RelatedLinks
      links={[
        { title: 'The Lab', description: 'Local AI, Macs, servers, and the network connecting them.', href: '/lab/' },
        { title: 'The Collection', description: 'Starships, spacecraft, supercars, and landmarks.', href: '/collection/' },
        { title: 'New York', description: 'A visual notebook about the city I call home.', href: '/new-york/' },
      ]}
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
